  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For a series <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;circuit, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi></math> vs <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi></math>&nbsp;curve is shown&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f01f324e-9e8b-4c63-9754-3bd1bb881fc8-image.png\" style=\"width: 210px; height: 178px;\" /></p><p>(a)&nbsp;To the left of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></math>, the circuit is mainly capacitive.<br />(b)&nbsp;To the left of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></math>, the circuit is mainly inductive.<br />(c)&nbsp;At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></math>, impedance of the circuit is equal to the resistance of the circuit.<br />(d)&nbsp;At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></math>, impedance of the circuit is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>Choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "tOdkF",
      "text": "(a) and (d) only",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zojNm",
      "text": "(b) and (d) only",
      "isCorrect": false,
